ostrya-mountd (0.10.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * ostrya-mountd reads a stored image from
    extensions/ostrya/composefs/AA/REST.cfs of the repository.
  * Each read of a file of the repository opens it with openat2,
    RESOLVE_BENEATH, and RESOLVE_NO_SYMLINKS. The daemon needs a kernel
    with openat2.
  * The refusal of an image whose digest is not the key of its commit
    names the commit and no digest.

 -- Alexey Naidyonov <alexey.naidyonov@gmail.com>  Sat, 07 Nov 2026 22:26:49 +0100

